{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_20cf0afd1bfc4fbfa799056a44053e60c1ad0c62da330a877eb445ace790d2ed","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_99bda921e5574741d312ccd450aa931ffc3f6625a67a4fdebf1845a26b32b210"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153"],"text":"The design doc states the seed prompt and the agent's self-description were collapsed into the same mutable file: the loop's only hardcoded context decision is reading self/SELF.md, re-read every turn so self-edits take effect immediately.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4ac7621e362e7ff4a6a5eaa471539192141fd7f2d8c224814b79729ccfbf7448","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4ab1ec9f24c751b306e9e591acc61104a53fbbf1703dca93ac65099d4eaae7db","slc_d13afdd823439521dba68886d1b82f62d38bde2efa0a05d2040dd28587f68f19"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153","src_eb80f4fa79135291822c7d1cf90b863a"],"text":"Documentation states models and keys are handled by Simon Willison's llm library, chosen over LiteLLM, PydanticAI, and a raw OpenAI SDK/OpenRouter combination for its multi-provider plugin model, per-conversation session state, and plain-function tool calling.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_52f744dcb896bdb82625534c942f6a7320cc5677be56c04fbb8d0b68b5776252","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2912f24040e533ffd73cda45dc626bff1ddfc1ace98dde85da176f9a4763b32e","slc_8d47cf26d5217e1fb2acb64fc78123dbaaf6fb5af5bfc4f24d25f653431e651a","slc_cf2d26e5ecfb3dbf296e41b854c774df5f58905caba2b0face33b840c26725ee"],"source_ids":["src_e09479005b3154c2825f71b48afc19be","src_eb80f4fa79135291822c7d1cf90b863a"],"text":"The license text labels itself Sovereign Source License v0.3 and describes an Apache 2.0 extension with optional development-data services. It says basic use under Apache 2.0 terms involves no data collection.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7470a553d2958b5c1989a003d9ebff2ee12c2ab84ae770dc2593dbcacde1fcf5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c1c27a332feb29a2f4b212b2e332bb267ab100a5c9a45bf1506af08b1702c126"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153"],"text":"The design document frames its distinct claim as germinating a personal agent from an auditable seed in dialogue, with conversation as selection pressure rather than a benchmark-driven optimization loop.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7579999285389999537281730cc0a3fe6ef67362161033c0032b571d2eb7cb78","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_205590af98e8011834f593ebfaeb5aebb348c33b9fe2c4249880f494b194cc78","slc_637a75d49983a2f4230fbd44ab0cb71b4a4f622222fd423d5f9fa0951110ed7e","slc_c724a52cd8dd5c635d3a33c4dda0bc5845848e36adee5693d57c4413cb158269"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153","src_eb80f4fa79135291822c7d1cf90b863a"],"text":"Documentation states planting creates a fresh, private git repo at the target directory (or nests git under self/ inside an existing repo) and never overwrites an existing seed.py or run_seed.sh, so a grown loop cannot be clobbered by a later plant.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7ccdf33d506a3508ca4925ede4604280a7f8cae461bb8f01c7a5879cbcb880ab","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_84b3bd16c8aac6c17cb92d151a14a4f0e6de8c00bad3a740cbd84bfb0b3bf70d"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153"],"text":"The risk register documents ungated exec as a consciously accepted risk: the agent runs arbitrary bash as the invoking user with no sandbox or approval gate, though every command and its output is printed to the terminal.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b0cd2e8c122e601bf592a9351e866f9f379e5e2c585889bc9ed34600889af803","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fb306a67e097e6df51102203cd5e22e867ee77a633e271f634ca15425271f637"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153"],"text":"The design doc states the one irreducible primitive is exec: the seed ships exactly one tool that runs a bash command and returns its output, with every other capability expressed through it rather than compressed further.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c51554f832154dc9ec002117528db5497c86f528de2a0c23195766dc20bd08b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22751520ea9ffcce4afb02be120d26ed3184a820dfc7e2cb1d2dfedd328cf1bf","slc_4ab1ec9f24c751b306e9e591acc61104a53fbbf1703dca93ac65099d4eaae7db","slc_a6999b7fd3604ff45d7d9fdf562ebff00eabb2f0c99050a3d9779b88e243bf57"],"source_ids":["src_eb80f4fa79135291822c7d1cf90b863a"],"text":"Setup is documented as detecting an existing provider credential or asking interactively, verifying it with one minimal model request unless --no-verify is passed, and storing a pasted key only in llm's user-level key store, never writing it into run_seed.sh, seed.py, or git.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_caa1e9c43fbcf3d467be6d59e5648a07cfc0d73779707ab8f83efa73f16a1425","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"vivekhaldar/seed@cd79a60acafe snapshot 1c4ee6f29e9155bf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_803abcfa1c669721b5ae87c37a9167c8616676476519833c9bc616ea7ccd9012","slc_9ff5c87d37d66bf1492de2dda29e2d19ad8e717e185fbe5a49fc00169508e1a7"],"source_ids":["src_de619aa1d3955a94b6495120e2652153","src_eb80f4fa79135291822c7d1cf90b863a"],"text":"Documentation states each session is fresh and its conversation is discarded on exit, so nothing survives except what the agent wrote into self/; a separate verbatim transcript is recorded per session as a flight recorder that is never loaded at boot.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:05:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_c5c7fa2a7f2748329b6516d55f3b1d58"}
